@baseUrl = http://localhost:5131
@checkIn = 2026-11-01
@checkOut = 2026-11-03
@hotelId = 1
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_CURRENT_ACCOUNT_JWT

### Public discovery: reference price, dates, total guests and rooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/discovery/hotels?location=Huế&checkIn={{checkIn}}&checkOut={{checkOut}}&adults=4&children=0&rooms=2&minPrice=0&sort=price_asc&page=1&pageSize=12

### Public detail (active hotel only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/discovery/hotels/{{hotelId}}?checkIn={{checkIn}}&checkOut={{checkOut}}

### Current account Wishlist
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/wishlist
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Idempotent save
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/me/wishlist/{{hotelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Idempotent remove
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/me/wishlist/{{hotelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Published cancellation text (Admin; not a payment formula)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/hotels/{{hotelId}}/policy
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cancellationPolicy": "Vui lòng liên hệ khách sạn để xác nhận điều kiện hủy." }

### Admin overview: exclusive end date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reports/overview?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-12-01&hotelId={{hotelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin CSV (same filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reports/export?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-12-01&hotelId={{hotelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
